# whisper.xcframework is built locally from
# https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp via:
#
#   git clone --depth 1 --branch v1.8.4 https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp.git
#   cd whisper.cpp
#   BUILD_STATIC_XCFRAMEWORK=ON ./build-xcframework.sh
#   mv build-apple/whisper.xcframework <repo>/corpan/plugins/tauri-plugin-stt/ios/
#
# 184 MB across all Apple slices (iOS device + sim + macOS + tvOS + visionOS).
# We don't commit it because of size; SPM consumes it as a local
# binaryTarget (see Package.swift) so it just has to exist on disk
# at build time. CI / clean checkouts will need to run the build
# script before `cargo tauri ios dev`.
whisper.xcframework/
